# Spicy Meal — Expo mobile app environment.
#
# Expo exposes ONLY variables prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_ to the app bundle.
# The anon (public) key is safe to ship: Row-Level Security is the real
# security boundary. NEVER put the Supabase service_role key, a payment secret,
# an SMS key, or a Lazywait token here — those live server-side only
# (integration_settings table / Edge Function secrets), never in the app.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill from your Supabase project
# (Settings -> API). These are the SAME project values the web/admin app uses.

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL="https://YOUR-PROJECT-ref.supabase.co"
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="YOUR-anon-public-key"
